{"transcription": [{"offsets": {"from": 1000, "to": 5000}, "text": " Hi, it's Ghostbusters Afterlife final trailer reaction time."}, {"offsets": {"from": 5000, "to": 8000}, "text": " I didn't think they'd actually release a final trailer for this,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 8000, "to": 12000}, "text": " because they've done lots of, like, pre-release screenings"}, {"offsets": {"from": 12000, "to": 17000}, "text": " and, like everyone says, it's absolutely killer, it's fantastic."}, {"offsets": {"from": 17000, "to": 21000}, "text": " So, I don't think there's any negative press about this thing,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 21000, "to": 24000}, "text": " so I'm not sure why they needed to increase the hype a bit more,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 24000, "to": 29000}, "text": " but hey, this is good, we get another Ghostbusters Afterlife reaction."}, {"offsets": {"from": 29000, "to": 32000}, "text": " So, I've done two previous ones, I believe it is,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 32000, "to": 35000}, "text": " and yeah, I'm very excited for Ghostbusters Afterlife."}, {"offsets": {"from": 35000, "to": 39000}, "text": " I'm a huge Ghostbusters fan. I have my... have the outfit on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 39000, "to": 41000}, "text": " Jones, thank you very much."}, {"offsets": {"from": 41000, "to": 48000}, "text": " So, it comes out in Australia, I believe, 1st of January."}, {"offsets": {"from": 48000, "to": 51000}, "text": " So, I don't know if there'll be, like, a midnight screening."}, {"offsets": {"from": 51000, "to": 54000}, "text": " If there is, I will go to that right on New Year's Eve."}, {"offsets": {"from": 54000, "to": 59000}, "text": " If there's a stroke of midnight, that'd be fantastic. I'm there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 59000, "to": 61000}, "text": " So, yes, I'm super pumped about this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 61000, "to": 65000}, "text": " I loved the last two trailers, and I love the fact that they..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 65000, "to": 67000}, "text": " By the way, if you just want to skip to my reaction,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 67000, "to": 69000}, "text": " I'll put a time link down below."}, {"offsets": {"from": 69000, "to": 71000}, "text": " Just go to the bar and see it, because I'll yap on for plenty..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 71000, "to": 73000}, "text": " five or ten minutes here, probably."}, {"offsets": {"from": 73000, "to": 78000}, "text": " Yeah, I loved the previous trailers in the fact that they didn't reveal too much."}, {"offsets": {"from": 78000, "to": 80000}, "text": " I hate trailers that reveal too much."}, {"offsets": {"from": 80000, "to": 82000}, "text": " You sort of want to set the scene,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 82000, "to": 84000}, "text": " and they didn't show the original Ghostbusters,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 84000, "to": 86000}, "text": " which I was very happy with,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 86000, "to": 89000}, "text": " apart from, you know, Dan Aykroyd's voiceover at the end,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 89000, "to": 91000}, "text": " which was beautiful."}, {"offsets": {"from": 91000, "to": 94000}, "text": " You know, he's back in his Razorcult bookshop,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 94000, "to": 95000}, "text": " and, you know, he picks up the phone."}, {"offsets": {"from": 95000, "to": 97000}, "text": " Sorry, we're closed."}, {"offsets": {"from": 97000, "to": 99000}, "text": " And, yeah, it's great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 99000, "to": 102000}, "text": " So, I hope they don't actually show the original Ghostbusters in there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 102000, "to": 104000}, "text": " I hope it's just, like, voiceovers."}, {"offsets": {"from": 104000, "to": 109000}, "text": " You know, I would accept, like, a little tease or something like that,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 109000, "to": 112000}, "text": " but I don't want to see them, you know, like, out there shooting the packs and everything."}, {"offsets": {"from": 112000, "to": 114000}, "text": " I want something for the cinema."}, {"offsets": {"from": 114000, "to": 115000}, "text": " Thank you very much."}, {"offsets": {"from": 115000, "to": 119000}, "text": " And, yeah, I reckon these trailers have been done superbly by Jason Reitman."}, {"offsets": {"from": 119000, "to": 122000}, "text": " I'm assuming he's the one that edits them,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 122000, "to": 124000}, "text": " but he'd be pretty close to the action if he's not."}, {"offsets": {"from": 124000, "to": 127000}, "text": " Anyway, yeah, I think he's done a great job,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 127000, "to": 129000}, "text": " because I didn't really... even though I'm a huge Ghostbusters fan,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 129000, "to": 131000}, "text": " and, yes, that includes the second one,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 131000, "to": 134000}, "text": " I don't understand the hate for the second Ghostbusters movie."}, {"offsets": {"from": 134000, "to": 135000}, "text": " I think it's fine."}, {"offsets": {"from": 135000, "to": 137000}, "text": " Yeah, it's not as good as the original,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 137000, "to": 140000}, "text": " but lots of classic lines in it, lots of classic scenes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 140000, "to": 144000}, "text": " No, I just don't understand the hate for it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 144000, "to": 147000}, "text": " Anyway, yeah, we did not need a third Ghostbusters,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 147000, "to": 149000}, "text": " where they're just in New York, and they're old guys,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 149000, "to": 150000}, "text": " and they're busting ghosts again."}, {"offsets": {"from": 150000, "to": 152000}, "text": " I would have happily gone to watch it,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 152000, "to": 155000}, "text": " but, yeah, I think, yeah, the torch needed to be passed,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 155000, "to": 158000}, "text": " and I think this is a brilliant way to do it,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 158000, "to": 162000}, "text": " handing it on to Egon's granddaughter."}, {"offsets": {"from": 162000, "to": 166000}, "text": " I still don't know if Finn Wolfhardt in this is his grandson."}, {"offsets": {"from": 166000, "to": 168000}, "text": " I'm not sure if they're brother and sister."}, {"offsets": {"from": 168000, "to": 170000}, "text": " I'm still not 100% sure about that,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 170000, "to": 171000}, "text": " but, yeah, I'm not sure what the deal is."}, {"offsets": {"from": 171000, "to": 172000}, "text": " But she is, apparently."}, {"offsets": {"from": 172000, "to": 175000}, "text": " She's Egon's granddaughter."}, {"offsets": {"from": 175000, "to": 181000}, "text": " And, yeah, that's just, like, a superb way to do it,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 181000, "to": 182000}, "text": " to hand it over."}, {"offsets": {"from": 182000, "to": 184000}, "text": " So, yeah, but I hope they don't make"}, {"offsets": {"from": 184000, "to": 186000}, "text": " the thing that will piss me off in this movie,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 186000, "to": 188000}, "text": " which I'm sure everyone would have said by now."}, {"offsets": {"from": 188000, "to": 190000}, "text": " It would have leaked out if this was the case,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 190000, "to": 194000}, "text": " that, no, they just make, you know, the kids, the heroes,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 194000, "to": 196000}, "text": " and the Ghostbusters just, like, are all decrepit,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 196000, "to": 200000}, "text": " old, useless guys who can't do anything anymore."}, {"offsets": {"from": 200000, "to": 203000}, "text": " You know, they just humiliate them just for the sake of it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 203000, "to": 205000}, "text": " No, I don't want to see that,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 205000, "to": 208000}, "text": " but I'm sure Jason Reitman has not done that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 208000, "to": 210000}, "text": " So, yeah, I'm getting the impression"}, {"offsets": {"from": 210000, "to": 212000}, "text": " that they don't play a huge part in it, which is fine,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 212000, "to": 215000}, "text": " but I just want to see them fire up the packs again"}, {"offsets": {"from": 215000, "to": 216000}, "text": " for one more go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 216000, "to": 219000}, "text": " So, anyway, yeah, I love the fact that it's sort of,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 219000, "to": 221000}, "text": " you know, it's gone back to the original roots."}, {"offsets": {"from": 221000, "to": 223000}, "text": " It's dark, it's gloomy, it's in a small town,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 223000, "to": 227000}, "text": " and the poster art looks absolutely brilliant."}, {"offsets": {"from": 227000, "to": 228000}, "text": " It's fantastic. I love it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 228000, "to": 231000}, "text": " You know, they find the old, the story's just great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 231000, "to": 233000}, "text": " You know, the granddaughter inherits the house,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 233000, "to": 235000}, "text": " finds the old Ghostbusting gear,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 235000, "to": 237000}, "text": " and they've been out of business for 30 years,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 237000, "to": 240000}, "text": " and, you know, everyone's basically forgotten about them."}, {"offsets": {"from": 240000, "to": 242000}, "text": " The kids these days don't know about them."}, {"offsets": {"from": 242000, "to": 244000}, "text": " They've got to show the kids the YouTube,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 244000, "to": 247000}, "text": " the old YouTube, the old videos, which are now on YouTube,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 247000, "to": 250000}, "text": " and gathering dust on YouTube somewhere,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 250000, "to": 252000}, "text": " and it's just great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 252000, "to": 254000}, "text": " I'm loving everything about this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 254000, "to": 257000}, "text": " So, let's see what the third trailer,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 257000, "to": 259000}, "text": " or final trailer, has in store."}, {"offsets": {"from": 259000, "to": 264000}, "text": " So, I probably expect some more voiceover-y type stuff."}, {"offsets": {"from": 264000, "to": 267000}, "text": " So, I've got all my audio set."}, {"offsets": {"from": 267000, "to": 269000}, "text": " So, yeah, I probably don't expect to see"}, {"offsets": {"from": 269000, "to": 270000}, "text": " the original Ghostbusters in it,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 270000, "to": 272000}, "text": " but probably get some more voiceover,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 272000, "to": 274000}, "text": " because I like the voiceover stuff they did"}, {"offsets": {"from": 274000, "to": 276000}, "text": " in the first couple of trailers."}, {"offsets": {"from": 276000, "to": 278000}, "text": " I thought that was really good."}, {"offsets": {"from": 278000, "to": 280000}, "text": " So, yeah, they just reused the lines and respun it,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 280000, "to": 282000}, "text": " and it was great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 282000, "to": 284000}, "text": " So, yep, let's go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 284000, "to": 286000}, "text": " Here we go, right, everything's on, speakers off."}, {"offsets": {"from": 286000, "to": 288000}, "text": " Right, let's go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 288000, "to": 289000}, "text": " Here we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 289000, "to": 292000}, "text": " Oh, by the way, it's got 5.6 thousand thumbs up"}, {"offsets": {"from": 292000, "to": 294000}, "text": " and 135 thumbs down."}, {"offsets": {"from": 294000, "to": 298000}, "text": " 135 sad sack SJWs who are still upset"}, {"offsets": {"from": 298000, "to": 302000}, "text": " about the reaction to the 2016 or whatever it was."}, {"offsets": {"from": 302000, "to": 303000}, "text": " What a joke."}, {"offsets": {"from": 303000, "to": 304000}, "text": " One of the worst movies of all time."}, {"offsets": {"from": 304000, "to": 305000}, "text": " Terrible."}, {"offsets": {"from": 305000, "to": 307000}, "text": " Absolutely disgusting."}, {"offsets": {"from": 307000, "to": 308000}, "text": " Anyway, let's go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 308000, "to": 309000}, "text": " Ready?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 309000, "to": 311000}, "text": " Here we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 326000, "to": 328000}, "text": " Symmetrical book stacking."}, {"offsets": {"from": 328000, "to": 330000}, "text": " Terror dogs."}, {"offsets": {"from": 339000, "to": 340000}, "text": " Yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 359000, "to": 360000}, "text": " Yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 361000, "to": 362000}, "text": " Yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 362000, "to": 363000}, "text": " Yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 363000, "to": 364000}, "text": " Yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 364000, "to": 365000}, "text": " November 19th."}, {"offsets": {"from": 365000, "to": 366000}, "text": " Oh, man."}, {"offsets": {"from": 366000, "to": 370000}, "text": " Oh, yeah, because we normally get things here first in Australia."}, {"offsets": {"from": 370000, "to": 372000}, "text": " Like, we normally get to see it first,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 372000, "to": 374000}, "text": " but yeah, November 19th."}, {"offsets": {"from": 374000, "to": 376000}, "text": " Everywhere else, is it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 376000, "to": 378000}, "text": " So, that's only a couple of weeks away."}, {"offsets": {"from": 378000, "to": 380000}, "text": " Oh, are we going to wait till January 1st?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 380000, "to": 381000}, "text": " Oh, goodness."}, {"offsets": {"from": 381000, "to": 382000}, "text": " That was great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 382000, "to": 383000}, "text": " Yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 383000, "to": 384000}, "text": " Yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 384000, "to": 385000}, "text": " Yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 385000, "to": 386000}, "text": " Yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 386000, "to": 387000}, "text": " Yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 387000, "to": 388000}, "text": " Yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 389000, "to": 390000}, "text": " That..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 390000, "to": 391000}, "text": " That was great, yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 391000, "to": 392000}, "text": " Right at the end there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 392000, "to": 393000}, "text": " That's what..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 393000, "to": 394000}, "text": " Oh, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 394000, "to": 397000}, "text": " I didn't want to see them, but you've missed us."}, {"offsets": {"from": 397000, "to": 398000}, "text": " Let me do that again."}, {"offsets": {"from": 402000, "to": 403000}, "text": " Ha-ha-ha great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 403000, "to": 404000}, "text": " Great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 404000, "to": 405000}, "text": " And yeah, she was right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 405000, "to": 408000}, "text": " So, the grandfatheres called up Ray and said,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 408000, "to": 411000}, "text": " yeah, I'm calling about what happened in New York."}, {"offsets": {"from": 411000, "to": 412000}, "text": " Wow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 412000, "to": 414000}, "text": " And we saw she was cooperating with one of the"}, {"offsets": {"from": 414000, "to": 415000}, "text": " Avengers syndicate."}, {"offsets": {"from": 415000, "to": 416000}, "text": " Which is an American team."}, {"offsets": {"from": 416000, "to": 417000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 417000, "to": 418000}, "text": " Wow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 418000, "to": 419000}, "text": " And yep, that's..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 419000, "to": 420000}, "text": " I've got to see that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 420000, "to": 421000}, "text": " I've got to watch this whole thing again."}, {"offsets": {"from": 421000, "to": 422000}, "text": " This is so good."}, {"offsets": {"from": 422000, "to": 424000}, "text": " There's lots of little things in here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 425000, "to": 426000}, "text": " I'll pause it now."}, {"offsets": {"from": 428000, "to": 429000}, "text": " Right, so we get a..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 429000, "to": 432000}, "text": " So, what's it doing on the top of the car?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 432000, "to": 433000}, "text": " Were they using it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 433000, "to": 436000}, "text": " So, I love the clamp over here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 436000, "to": 438000}, "text": " So, were they trying to head on the top of the car?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 438000, "to": 440000}, "text": " They're trying to catch a ghost?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 440000, "to": 441000}, "text": " Well, they've obviously caught one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 441000, "to": 442000}, "text": " There's one in there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 442000, "to": 443000}, "text": " Because it's doing its..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 443000, "to": 445000}, "text": " It's doing its thing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 445000, "to": 450000}, "text": " So, I presume that he caught a ghost."}, {"offsets": {"from": 450000, "to": 451000}, "text": " I would presume."}, {"offsets": {"from": 451000, "to": 452000}, "text": " That he's caught one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 452000, "to": 454000}, "text": " We've got the school bus."}, {"offsets": {"from": 454000, "to": 456000}, "text": " And, I don't know."}, {"offsets": {"from": 459000, "to": 460000}, "text": " Wow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 460000, "to": 461000}, "text": " Yeah, it's all dark and gloomy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 463000, "to": 464000}, "text": " Love the voiceover."}, {"offsets": {"from": 464000, "to": 466000}, "text": " Symmetrical book stacking."}, {"offsets": {"from": 468000, "to": 470000}, "text": " And we get to see more of this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 470000, "to": 471000}, "text": " Terrific."}, {"offsets": {"from": 471000, "to": 472000}, "text": " That was great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 473000, "to": 475000}, "text": " And, yeah, the Shandor Mine thing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 475000, "to": 476000}, "text": " I didn't see it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 476000, "to": 478000}, "text": " I don't think we saw a lot of the Shandor Mine in here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 478000, "to": 479000}, "text": " But, Razor Colts."}, {"offsets": {"from": 483000, "to": 484000}, "text": " That's great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 484000, "to": 485000}, "text": " That's great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 487000, "to": 488000}, "text": " Now, let's suck her up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 496000, "to": 497000}, "text": " It's great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 499000, "to": 500000}, "text": " The miner from the mine."}, {"offsets": {"from": 500000, "to": 501000}, "text": " Now, what is this?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 501000, "to": 502000}, "text": " Yeah, we saw him."}, {"offsets": {"from": 502000, "to": 503000}, "text": " This one-eyed..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 504000, "to": 505000}, "text": " This giant..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 505000, "to": 506000}, "text": " This one-eyed monster."}, {"offsets": {"from": 506000, "to": 508000}, "text": " I don't think we've seen him before, have we?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 509000, "to": 510000}, "text": " And, here we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 510000, "to": 511000}, "text": " This is new."}, {"offsets": {"from": 511000, "to": 512000}, "text": " She's battling."}, {"offsets": {"from": 512000, "to": 515000}, "text": " This would be one of her first battles."}, {"offsets": {"from": 515000, "to": 517000}, "text": " This is her first battle, right?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 518000, "to": 519000}, "text": " She's trying to bust this ghost,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 519000, "to": 522000}, "text": " which we saw in the first trailer in this warehouse thing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 528000, "to": 529000}, "text": " Great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 529000, "to": 530000}, "text": " That's why he bought the house."}, {"offsets": {"from": 530000, "to": 532000}, "text": " He knew, Spengler knew,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 532000, "to": 535000}, "text": " that, you know, the Shandor Mine"}, {"offsets": {"from": 535000, "to": 537000}, "text": " was where it was all happening."}, {"offsets": {"from": 537000, "to": 538000}, "text": " That's why he bought the house there,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 538000, "to": 540000}, "text": " and he was investigating it for,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 540000, "to": 541000}, "text": " I don't know, however long."}, {"offsets": {"from": 541000, "to": 542000}, "text": " Decades, probably."}, {"offsets": {"from": 543000, "to": 544000}, "text": " That's great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 544000, "to": 545000}, "text": " To bust."}, {"offsets": {"from": 545000, "to": 546000}, "text": " Oh!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 546000, "to": 547000}, "text": " Was..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 547000, "to": 549000}, "text": " Was he shooting something?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 549000, "to": 551000}, "text": " Or is that my imagination?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 554000, "to": 555000}, "text": " It's just..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 555000, "to": 556000}, "text": " I don't know."}, {"offsets": {"from": 556000, "to": 557000}, "text": " It just sounded like..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 557000, "to": 559000}, "text": " It sounded like machine gun fire."}, {"offsets": {"from": 561000, "to": 562000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 562000, "to": 563000}, "text": " Yeah, it looks fun."}, {"offsets": {"from": 563000, "to": 564000}, "text": " Looks fun."}, {"offsets": {"from": 564000, "to": 565000}, "text": " I'm liking it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 565000, "to": 566000}, "text": " I'm liking."}, {"offsets": {"from": 566000, "to": 567000}, "text": " Well done."}, {"offsets": {"from": 567000, "to": 568000}, "text": " Yes, I did not want to see"}, {"offsets": {"from": 568000, "to": 570000}, "text": " the faces"}, {"offsets": {"from": 570000, "to": 572000}, "text": " of the original, right?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 573000, "to": 574000}, "text": " Who have we got?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 574000, "to": 576000}, "text": " We've got the three"}, {"offsets": {"from": 576000, "to": 577000}, "text": " original."}, {"offsets": {"from": 577000, "to": 578000}, "text": " I really wanted"}, {"offsets": {"from": 578000, "to": 580000}, "text": " Janine Melnitz"}, {"offsets": {"from": 580000, "to": 581000}, "text": " to join them,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 581000, "to": 582000}, "text": " to be,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 582000, "to": 583000}, "text": " to, you know,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 583000, "to": 585000}, "text": " be the fourth original Ghostbuster."}, {"offsets": {"from": 585000, "to": 587000}, "text": " I thought that would be really cool"}, {"offsets": {"from": 587000, "to": 588000}, "text": " to see that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 588000, "to": 589000}, "text": " So,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 589000, "to": 590000}, "text": " yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 590000, "to": 591000}, "text": " So we've got three of them."}, {"offsets": {"from": 592000, "to": 593000}, "text": " Light them up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 594000, "to": 595000}, "text": " This is great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 598000, "to": 599000}, "text": " And it's the way they're cutting it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 599000, "to": 601000}, "text": " So I don't know who they're,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 601000, "to": 602000}, "text": " who they're battling there,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 602000, "to": 603000}, "text": " whether or not they come in"}, {"offsets": {"from": 603000, "to": 604000}, "text": " like at the final boss scene,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 604000, "to": 605000}, "text": " or whatever."}, {"offsets": {"from": 605000, "to": 606000}, "text": " Because obviously they're going to,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 606000, "to": 607000}, "text": " you know,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 607000, "to": 608000}, "text": " it's probably going to be"}, {"offsets": {"from": 608000, "to": 609000}, "text": " the final battle at the mine"}, {"offsets": {"from": 609000, "to": 611000}, "text": " or something like that, perhaps."}, {"offsets": {"from": 611000, "to": 612000}, "text": " So, I don't know."}, {"offsets": {"from": 612000, "to": 613000}, "text": " I got no idea."}, {"offsets": {"from": 613000, "to": 616000}, "text": " But I've heard that the fan service,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 616000, "to": 618000}, "text": " there's a lot of people complaining"}, {"offsets": {"from": 618000, "to": 620000}, "text": " that the fan service is too much"}, {"offsets": {"from": 621000, "to": 622000}, "text": " and stuff."}, {"offsets": {"from": 622000, "to": 623000}, "text": " But, like, I don't know."}, {"offsets": {"from": 623000, "to": 625000}, "text": " I don't think you can..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 625000, "to": 626000}, "text": " I love the little,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 627000, "to": 629000}, "text": " little mouth and the eyes pop open"}, {"offsets": {"from": 629000, "to": 630000}, "text": " after it's been blended."}, {"offsets": {"from": 630000, "to": 631000}, "text": " That's great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 631000, "to": 632000}, "text": " I love,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 632000, "to": 634000}, "text": " I love just the comedy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 635000, "to": 636000}, "text": " Boom!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 637000, "to": 638000}, "text": " It's great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 638000, "to": 640000}, "text": " There's a lot of people that don't like"}, {"offsets": {"from": 640000, "to": 641000}, "text": " the little mini,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 641000, "to": 643000}, "text": " the baby Stay Puft marshmallows."}, {"offsets": {"from": 643000, "to": 644000}, "text": " But I think they're great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 644000, "to": 645000}, "text": " I think they're great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 645000, "to": 646000}, "text": " So, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 646000, "to": 647000}, "text": " Yeah, very happy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 647000, "to": 649000}, "text": " But I'd love to see Janine Melnitz"}, {"offsets": {"from": 649000, "to": 651000}, "text": " join the original crew"}, {"offsets": {"from": 651000, "to": 652000}, "text": " and bust some ghosts."}, {"offsets": {"from": 652000, "to": 653000}, "text": " I think that'd be cool."}, {"offsets": {"from": 655000, "to": 656000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 656000, "to": 657000}, "text": " I think that's done."}, {"offsets": {"from": 657000, "to": 658000}, "text": " It's done really well."}, {"offsets": {"from": 658000, "to": 659000}, "text": " It's only, like, less than a minute."}, {"offsets": {"from": 659000, "to": 661000}, "text": " Doesn't show much at all."}, {"offsets": {"from": 661000, "to": 662000}, "text": " But, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 662000, "to": 663000}, "text": " That's what you want."}, {"offsets": {"from": 663000, "to": 664000}, "text": " So, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 664000, "to": 665000}, "text": " I'm very happy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 665000, "to": 666000}, "text": " Very happy with what's coming."}, {"offsets": {"from": 666000, "to": 668000}, "text": " I don't think I'm going to be disappointed."}, {"offsets": {"from": 668000, "to": 669000}, "text": " I..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 669000, "to": 672000}, "text": " Everyone raves about the fan service in it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 672000, "to": 673000}, "text": " It's just incredible."}, {"offsets": {"from": 673000, "to": 675000}, "text": " I'm not above some fan service."}, {"offsets": {"from": 675000, "to": 676000}, "text": " Serve me."}, {"offsets": {"from": 676000, "to": 677000}, "text": " Serve me."}, {"offsets": {"from": 680000, "to": 681000}, "text": " Raise a call."}, {"offsets": {"from": 681000, "to": 683000}, "text": " I'm calling about what happened in New York."}, {"offsets": {"from": 686000, "to": 688000}, "text": " There hasn't been a ghost sighting in 30 years."}, {"offsets": {"from": 688000, "to": 689000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 689000, "to": 690000}, "text": " It's done right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 690000, "to": 691000}, "text": " I mean, it's..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 691000, "to": 693000}, "text": " And it adds the humour to it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 693000, "to": 694000}, "text": " It's great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 694000, "to": 696000}, "text": " But it's still got the horror elements."}, {"offsets": {"from": 696000, "to": 697000}, "text": " It's dark."}, {"offsets": {"from": 697000, "to": 698000}, "text": " It's gloomy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 698000, "to": 699000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 699000, "to": 701000}, "text": " And they'll actually bust some ghosts."}, {"offsets": {"from": 701000, "to": 702000}, "text": " Unlike..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 702000, "to": 703000}, "text": " Capture ghosts."}, {"offsets": {"from": 704000, "to": 706000}, "text": " Unlike bloody 2016 garbage."}, {"offsets": {"from": 706000, "to": 709000}, "text": " He's shooting something, right?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 709000, "to": 711000}, "text": " The ghost was shooting something."}, {"offsets": {"from": 718000, "to": 719000}, "text": " That's great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 719000, "to": 720000}, "text": " Alright."}, {"offsets": {"from": 720000, "to": 721000}, "text": " That's a winner, winner, chicken dinner."}, {"offsets": {"from": 721000, "to": 722000}, "text": " I'm giving that a thumbs up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 722000, "to": 724000}, "text": " That is terrific."}, {"offsets": {"from": 724000, "to": 728000}, "text": " I trust Jason Reitman to do it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 728000, "to": 729000}, "text": " Who was..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 729000, "to": 730000}, "text": " For those who don't know,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 730000, "to": 731000}, "text": " he was in..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 731000, "to": 733000}, "text": " He acted in the second Ghostbusters."}, {"offsets": {"from": 733000, "to": 735000}, "text": " He was the kid at the party"}, {"offsets": {"from": 735000, "to": 738000}, "text": " who told him off."}, {"offsets": {"from": 738000, "to": 739000}, "text": " It's great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 739000, "to": 741000}, "text": " Sit down and we'll have fun."}, {"offsets": {"from": 741000, "to": 742000}, "text": " Yeah!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 743000, "to": 746000}, "text": " You know, my dad says you guys are full of crap."}, {"offsets": {"from": 746000, "to": 749000}, "text": " Well, some people have trouble believing in the paranormal."}, {"offsets": {"from": 749000, "to": 751000}, "text": " No, he just says you guys are full of crap"}, {"offsets": {"from": 751000, "to": 753000}, "text": " and that's why you went out of business."}, {"offsets": {"from": 754000, "to": 755000}, "text": " Son."}, {"offsets": {"from": 757000, "to": 758000}, "text": " So, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 758000, "to": 760000}, "text": " And, of course, his dad was there"}, {"offsets": {"from": 760000, "to": 762000}, "text": " during the filming of this"}, {"offsets": {"from": 762000, "to": 766000}, "text": " and I've seen tons of Adam Savage stuff."}, {"offsets": {"from": 766000, "to": 768000}, "text": " He's done lots of, like, behind the scenes stuff"}, {"offsets": {"from": 768000, "to": 770000}, "text": " because he was on set of shooting this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 770000, "to": 771000}, "text": " He wasn't involved in the film,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 771000, "to": 773000}, "text": " but they let him on set to drive the car"}, {"offsets": {"from": 773000, "to": 774000}, "text": " and to look at the props"}, {"offsets": {"from": 774000, "to": 776000}, "text": " and do all sorts of other things"}, {"offsets": {"from": 776000, "to": 777000}, "text": " and that's been great"}, {"offsets": {"from": 777000, "to": 779000}, "text": " and they've put a lot of care,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 779000, "to": 780000}, "text": " a lot of thought into this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 780000, "to": 782000}, "text": " I love the symmetrical book stacking."}, {"offsets": {"from": 782000, "to": 784000}, "text": " Terrific stuff."}, {"offsets": {"from": 784000, "to": 786000}, "text": " Not as good as symmetrical multimeter stacking,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 786000, "to": 788000}, "text": " but, yep, I'll give it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 788000, "to": 789000}, "text": " Definitely."}, {"offsets": {"from": 789000, "to": 790000}, "text": " So, yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 790000, "to": 791000}, "text": " Can't wait."}, {"offsets": {"from": 791000, "to": 792000}, "text": " Bloody..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 792000, "to": 793000}, "text": " It's..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 793000, "to": 794000}, "text": " Ah!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 794000, "to": 795000}, "text": " 19th of..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 795000, "to": 796000}, "text": " Was it 19th of November"}, {"offsets": {"from": 796000, "to": 798000}, "text": " or was it 19th of December?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 798000, "to": 799000}, "text": " Sorry."}, {"offsets": {"from": 799000, "to": 801000}, "text": " No, yeah, November exclusively"}, {"offsets": {"from": 801000, "to": 803000}, "text": " in movie theatres, November 19th."}, {"offsets": {"from": 803000, "to": 805000}, "text": " Oh, man."}, {"offsets": {"from": 805000, "to": 807000}, "text": " I've got, like, six weeks to wait"}, {"offsets": {"from": 807000, "to": 809000}, "text": " before I can watch the damn thing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 809000, "to": 811000}, "text": " Unbelievable."}, {"offsets": {"from": 811000, "to": 812000}, "text": " Oh, anyway."}, {"offsets": {"from": 812000, "to": 813000}, "text": " It's going to be great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 813000, "to": 814000}, "text": " If it's on at midnight,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 814000, "to": 815000}, "text": " I'm going to go see it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 815000, "to": 817000}, "text": " Catch you next time."}], "source": "whisper-1-api"}